{"id": "63161", "title": "穿越之龙国", "author": "未知", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 12, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/63/63161.htm", "intro": "她原本只是想到Blue moon Island尝一尝翻云覆雨的滋味，谁知道竟然意外地穿越了！ \r\n\r\n不是她熟悉的历史的国家，没法成为女版项少龙，呃——好失望喔。 \r\n\r\n还意外地遇上野人，幕后还有阴谋？ \r\n\r\n噢，这次不止是翻云覆雨，简直是翻天了啦！", "base": "files/article/html/63/63161", "chapters": [{"title": "第一部分", "file": "9353447.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二部分", "file": "9353450.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三部分", "file": "9353452.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四部分", "file": "9353454.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五部分", "file": "9353456.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六部分", "file": "9353457.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七部分", "file": "9353458.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八部分", "file": "9353459.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九部分", "file": "9353461.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十部分", "file": "9353465.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11部分", "file": "9353466.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12部分", "file": "9353468.html", "available": false}]}